  assistant: I have identified the root cause: the tool executions during the reasoning phase do not emit the ToolUseStreamEvent with current_tool_use context before actually running, which prevents the PrintingCallbackHandler from showing those tools.

I have fixed this by modifying the tool executor (_executor.py) to always emit a ToolUseStreamEvent with current_tool_use just before streaming events from the actual tool execution.

Next, I recommend testing that tools executed during the reasoning phase...
